flowchart TD
    A[Merchant record pre-seeded<br/>name, address, phone, category<br/>from public business data] --> B[Status: UNCLAIMED]

    B --> C{First complaint arrives<br/>for this merchant}
    C -- Yes --> D[Complaint routes to merchant<br/>but sits in a holding queue]
    D --> E[Auto-email/text sent to<br/>merchant's listed phone/email:<br/>'A customer complaint is<br/>waiting for you on VentText']

    B --> F{Merchant proactively<br/>searches for their business}
    F --> G[Finds pre-seeded listing]

    E --> H[Merchant clicks claim link]
    G --> H

    H --> I[Enter phone number tied<br/>to the listing]
    I --> J[Verification code sent<br/>via SMS or email]
    J --> K{Code matches listed<br/>phone/email on file?}

    K -- No match --> L[Falls back to manual review:<br/>upload business license,<br/>utility bill, etc.]
    L --> M[Manual approval by VentText team]

    K -- Yes --> N[Status: CLAIMED]
    M --> N

    N --> O[Merchant sets up dashboard:<br/>coupon ceiling, response<br/>window, POS integration]
    O --> P[Any held complaints in queue<br/>release into active dashboard]

    D -.holding queue releases once claimed.-> P

    N --> Q[Future complaints route<br/>directly, no more holding]
